## Project snippets

A chronological log of project updates and notes. You can [subscribe via
RSS]($link.page('projects').alternative('rss')); this page lists entries for 2024,
and past or future years are in the [projects archive](/projects/).

## [Prototype slides presented]($section.id("2024-10-07T00:00:00"))
Internal presentation with updated slides describing prototypes for the [AI for
legal epidemiology](/trails/legal-epidemiology/) project. The slides are linked
from the project page.

## [Concept presented to COEP]($section.id("2024-03-28T00:00:00"))
Initial concept for the [legal epidemiology](/trails/legal-epidemiology/) project
presented to the
[COEP](https://med.nyu.edu/departments-institutes/population-health/divisions-sections-centers/epidemiology/center-opioid-epidemiology-policy)
center at NYU Langone.
